  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Innovation in Early Warning Systems: Building Climate Resilience in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Practical Action has bridged the gap in EWS generation and dissemination in Bangladesh by developing a mobile-based application to send out early warning for impending disasters, and enhancing preparedness, rescue and recovery. This programme will result in this Disaster Alert App being scaled up across other regions across Bangladesh and for additional disaster hazards.</narrative>
  </description>
